# (0.25) Files reads its folder again (DESK=1; tests/mousegen.py makes tests/files25.keys from
# this). The card gets tests/mk23.py's additions (a clock) and an empty /Printouts; emu816 with
# --classic-print tests/p23.atascii@16 --no-pc-print (a job in /Printouts at about 19 s), --pc-folder (a copy
# of tests/pc) and --pc-drop-at 30. Files is at (24, 24). Shots (s):
#   1  README.TXT selected in Files; the Terminal (in front) has copied it to /NEW.TXT: Files,
#      behind, does not show it yet
#   2  Alt+Tab: Files in front reads / again: NEW.TXT shows, README.TXT still selected
#   3  Files in /Printouts (empty); the classic Atari's job has arrived (the notice): not shown
#   4  F5: the job shows
#   5  Files in /PC:
#   6  the link dropped (30 s), View > Reload: "The PC link was lost" on the footer, no entries
